{"ID":"20240314092338-zh08ov2","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314092338-zh08ov2","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314092338-zh08ov2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422155310-5aeo1tj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422155310-u4qcraq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422155310-u4qcraq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:234,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:234\u0026#125;","title":"【栝楼牡蛎散】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422155310"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422155310-5aeo1tj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422155310-5aeo1tj","updated":"20240422155310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"百合病，渴不解者，栝蒌牡蛎散主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422155310-tuebt9r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155310-tuebt9r","updated":"20240422155310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"栝蒌牡蛎散方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422155310-dm4hymf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155310-dm4hymf","updated":"20240422155310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"栝萎根，牡蛎熬等分"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422155310-kd1xanz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155310-kd1xanz","updated":"20240422155310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右为细末，饮服方寸匕，日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422155310-2mqmkm7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155310-2mqmkm7","updated":"20240422155310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那，接下来呢，我们看，百合病，渴不解者，栝蒌牡蛎散。哦，我们中医呢，治渴的处方很多，这个处方很特殊，用在百合病里面，哦，这个栝蒌根呢，跟牡蛎混在一起用。那，如果说你不开牡蛎，大病初愈的人呢，你光开栝蒌根，他吃了还是渴，栝蒌根并没有办法帮他止渴。这就牵涉到，病人病好了以后，病人一定会虚，虚的现象出现，当我们发现到，病人有虚热的现象，才会渴不解，他没有热不会渴的，所以里寒证的时候，寒很盛的时候，病人不口渴。"}]},{"ID":"20240422155310-q2b6e3o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155310-q2b6e3o","updated":"20240422155310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那，所以你如果说你要到沙漠去旅游啊，去埃及啊，去一个礼拜，你想办法多吃一点石膏，去之前啊，可能你几天不喝水都不会怎么样啊，那，热证才会有口渴，那，口渴，这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"渴要去掉的话要靠牡蛎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，牡蛎是咸味的药，这个，味道很咸，它能够去他的虚热。所以我们桂枝汤，有时候加龙骨牡蛎啊，去一些虚热的症状。"}]},{"ID":"20240422155310-u4qcraq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155310-u4qcraq","updated":"20240422155310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那，中医是讲的是虚热，西医讲了可能就是钙，钙质，缺钙了或者怎么样子，你看西医的钙片就是牡蛎，你看内容是什么呢，就是牡蛎，提炼，从牡蛎提炼出来的。那，这个，如果碰到这种情形的时候，大病初愈的时候病人有这种情形的时候，我们把栝蒌根去渴的药跟去虚热的药放在一起的时候，就可以帮他治好，哦，就可以帮他把这个渴去掉。那牡蛎，看看，栝蒌根跟牡蛎，熬，这两个是等分，好，把它做成细末，这个方寸匕，一般就是汉朝的时候，他一个汤匙，就是方形的，用木头做的，汤匙，就是这样子，一天吃三次。"}]}]}